<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="bulb15" otherprops="legalnotice_europe-general_egall_2023_20230101_0000917">
    <title>Headlamp (Low beam) bulb (Bulb type B) replacement</title>
    <shortdesc/>
    <prolog>
        <metadata>
            <keywords>
                <indexterm>headlamp (low beam) bulb replacement (headlamp type B)</indexterm>
            </keywords>
        </metadata>
    </prolog>
    <conbody>
        <table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="table_k1r_5fj_pjc">
            <tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
                <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                <tbody>
                    <row rowsep="0">
                        <entry colname="col1">
                            <fig id="fig_l1r_5fj_pjc">
                                <figgroup>
                                    <image href="images/OJAPE073034.jpg" scale="95"
                                        align="center" placement="break" id="image_m1r_5fj_pjc"/>
                                </figgroup>
                            </fig>
                        </entry>
                        <entry colname="col2"/>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
        <ol id="ol_n1r_5fj_pjc">
            <li>
                <p>Open the hood.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Remove the headlamp bulb cover by turning it counterclockwise.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Remove the bulb-socket from the headlamp assembly by turning the bulb-socket
                    counterclockwise until the tabs on the bulb-socket align with the slots on the
                    headlamp assembly.</p>
            </li>
            <li>Remove the bulb from bulb-socket by pulling it out. Insert a new bulb by inserting
                it into the bulb-socket.</li>
            <li>
                <p> Install the bulb-socket in the headlamp assembly by aligning the tabs on the
                    bulb-socket with the slots in the headlamp assembly.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Push the bulb-socket into the headlamp assembly and turn the bulb-socket
                    clockwise.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Install the headlamp bulb cover by turning it clockwise.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </conbody>
</concept>
